#: ../../extend/provider.md:1
msgid "登录 Provider（`catalog = \"auth\"`）"
msgstr "Login providers (`catalog = \"auth\"`)"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:3
msgid "内置的 `oidc` 钩子（标准 OIDC 统一登录）就是按这份契约实现的，第三方包照着实现即可接入， 核心代码不需要改。"
msgstr ""
"The built-in `oidc` hook (standard OIDC single sign-on) is implemented against"
" this contract; a third-party package plugs in by doing the same, without"
" touching the core."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:6
msgid ""
"钩子只负责**与 Provider 对话**：拼授权地址、用授权码换用户信息。 浏览器跳转、state "
"Cookie、本地会话与建号/绑定全部由核心 "
"（`sapic/views/auth.py`、`sapic/libs/users.py`）负责，钩子里不要碰 Flask。"
msgstr ""
"The hook only **talks to the provider**: it builds the authorization URL "
"and exchanges the code for user info. Browser redirects, the state "
"cookie, the local session and account creation/linking are all handled by"
" the core (`sapic/views/auth.py`, `sapic/libs/users.py`) — do not touch "
"Flask inside a hook."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:10
msgid "契约"
msgstr "Contract"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "函数"
msgstr "Function"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`oidc_authorize_url`"
msgstr "`oidc_authorize_url`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid ""
"返回把浏览器送去 Provider 的完整地址。参数 `config` 是后台保存的钩子配置，`state` 必须原样带上（核心用 Cookie "
"校验回跳）；`redirect_uri` 是本站的回调地址（后台配置页可见），必须原样传给 Provider。失败抛 `ValueError`（英文消息），核心返回 400。"
msgstr ""
"Return the full URL that sends the browser to the provider. `config` is "
"the hook config saved in the admin, and `state` must be passed through "
"unchanged (the core validates it with a cookie on the way back); "
"`redirect_uri` is our callback URL (visible on the admin config page) and "
"must be passed to the provider unchanged. Raise `ValueError` (English "
"message) on failure and the core returns 400."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`oidc_exchange`"
msgstr "`oidc_exchange`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid ""
"用 `code` 换用户信息并返回下面的字典；`redirect_uri` 必须与授权时一致（多数 Provider 会校验）。抛 `ValueError`（英文消息，核心会写进日志）表示与 "
"Provider 对话失败，核心跳 `/login?oidc=provider`；其他异常跳 `/login?oidc=error`。消息里带上上游的 HTTP "
"状态与响应片段，排查时日志才有用。"
msgstr ""
"Exchange `code` for user info and return the dictionary described below; "
"`redirect_uri` must match the one used at authorization time (most "
"providers check it). Raising `ValueError` (English message, written to the "
"log) means the conversation with the provider failed and the core "
"redirects to `/login?oidc=provider`; any other exception redirects to "
"`/login?oidc=error`. Include the upstream HTTP status and a response "
"excerpt in the message — that is what makes the log useful."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`identity_issuer`"
msgstr "`identity_issuer`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid ""
"返回身份命名空间，写进本地账号的 `oidc_issuer`。缺省用 `config[\"issuer\"]`（适合 OIDC 的 issuer "
"地址）；非 OIDC 的 Provider（如 GitHub）用它声明一个固定值，否则「已绑定」判定会拿不到值。返回值与 "
"`config[\"issuer\"]` 都会去掉末尾 `/` 后使用（写入与「已绑定」判定走同一个归一化）。"
msgstr ""
"Return the identity namespace stored in the local `oidc_issuer`. By "
"default `config[\"issuer\"]` is used (which suits an OIDC issuer URL); "
"non-OIDC providers such as GitHub use it to declare a fixed value, "
"otherwise the already-bound check has nothing to compare. Both the return"
" value and `config[\"issuer\"]` are used with a trailing `/` stripped, "
"because writing and the bound check share one normalisation."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:26
msgid "`oidc_exchange` 的返回值："
msgstr "Return value of `oidc_exchange`:"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "键"
msgstr "Key"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "必需"
msgstr "Required"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`subject`"
msgstr "`subject`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "✅"
msgstr "✅"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid ""
"Provider 内稳定不变的唯一 ID（OIDC 的 `sub`、GitHub 的 `id`）。也接受 `sub` 别名，会被归一化成 "
"`subject`。"
msgstr ""
"Stable unique ID inside the provider (`sub` for OIDC, `id` for GitHub). "
"The `sub` alias is also accepted and normalised into `subject`."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`issuer`"
msgstr "`issuer`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid ""
"通常不用返回：核心优先用 `identity_issuer()` / `config[\"issuer\"]` "
"作为命名空间，保证与「已绑定」判定同源，仅当两者都没有时才采用此值。"
msgstr ""
"Usually unnecessary: the core prefers `identity_issuer()` / "
"`config[\"issuer\"]` as the namespace so it stays identical to the bound "
"check, and only uses this value when neither exists."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`username`"
msgstr "`username`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "建号时用作本地账号名；缺省用 `subject`。会被清洗成 `[0-9a-zA-Z_]`。"
msgstr ""
"Used as the local account name when creating an account; defaults to "
"`subject`. Sanitised to `[0-9a-zA-Z_]`."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`nickname`"
msgstr "`nickname`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "显示名，上游改名不影响本地账号。"
msgstr "Display name; renaming upstream does not affect the local account."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`email`"
msgstr "`email`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "用于「双方邮箱都验证过就自动关联老账号」。"
msgstr ""
"Used to link an existing account automatically when both sides have "
"verified the email."

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid "`email_verified`"
msgstr "`email_verified`"

#: ../../extend/provider.md
msgid ""
"布尔（也接受 `\"true\"` / `1`）。默认 `false`：Provider 没明确验证过邮箱时不要传 "
"`true`，否则等于允许抢填他人邮箱接管账号。"
msgstr ""
"Boolean (also accepts `\"true\"` / `1`). Defaults to `false`: do not pass"
" `true` unless the provider has explicitly verified the email, otherwise "
"anyone could claim somebody else email and take over the account."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:37
msgid ""
"校验由 `sapic/libs/ext.py` 的 `normalize_identity()` 统一做：类型、长度都会收敛， 没有 "
"`subject` 一律判为无效（跳 `/login?oidc=invalid`），不会落下空身份。"
msgstr ""
"Validation happens in `normalize_identity()` in `sapic/libs/ext.py`: "
"types and lengths are clamped, and anything without a `subject` is "
"rejected (redirect to `/login?oidc=invalid`), so no empty identity is "
"ever stored."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:40
msgid "登录与绑定流程"
msgstr "Login and binding flow"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:49
msgid ""
"`<name>` 是**钩子名**（模块名）。包名写成 `sapic_oauth_github`，地址就是 "
"`/api/v2/auth/oidc/sapic_oauth_github`，回调 "
"`/api/v2/auth/oidc/sapic_oauth_github/callback`。"
msgstr ""
"`<name>` is the **hook name** (module name). A package named "
"`sapic_oauth_github` is served at `/api/v2/auth/oidc/sapic_oauth_github`, "
"with its callback at "
"`/api/v2/auth/oidc/sapic_oauth_github/callback`."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:56
msgid ""
"内置 `oidc` 钩子固定用 `/api/v2/auth/oidc` 与 `/api/v2/auth/oidc/callback`；"
"第三方 provider 的名字只要不是 `oidc`，就自动落到通用路由，无需核心登记。"
msgstr ""
"The built-in `oidc` hook uses `/api/v2/auth/oidc` and "
"`/api/v2/auth/oidc/callback`. Any third-party provider whose name is not "
"`oidc` automatically uses the generic routes — no core registration needed."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:59
msgid ""
"**回调地址在后台「钩子 → 配置」页自动显示并可复制**（字段 `callback_url`）："
"启用 provider 后打开配置页即可看到，复制去 Provider 控制台登记 Redirect URI。"
"回调地址由部署域名生成，换域名后要重新登记。"
msgstr ""
"**The callback URL is shown and copyable on the admin \"Hooks → Config\" "
"page** (field `callback_url`): enable the provider, open its config page, "
"then copy the URL into the provider console as the Redirect URI. The URL "
"is generated from the deployment domain, so re-register it after a domain "
"change."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:51
msgid ""
"`bind=1` 表示把身份绑到当前登录账号（要求已登录），完成后回 `next` 并带 "
"`?identity=bound`；失败分两种：`identity=conflict`（该身份已被另一个账号绑定， 需先去那边解绑）与 "
"`identity=error`（其他原因）。"
msgstr ""
"`bind=1` binds the identity to the currently signed-in account (login "
"required); afterwards it returns to `next` with `?identity=bound`. "
"Failures come in two flavours: `identity=conflict` (the identity is "
"already bound to another account — unbind it there first) and "
"`identity=error` (anything else)."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:54
msgid ""
"登录失败的回跳标记：`denied`（用户在 Provider 拒绝）、`provider`（与 Provider 对话失败， "
"如令牌交换被拒、userinfo 报错）、`error`（钩子抛了非 `ValueError` 异常）、 `invalid`（claims 缺 "
"`subject`）、`unlinked`（该身份没绑定本地账号）、`inactive`（账号已拒绝/被禁用）。"
msgstr "Failure markers on the redirect: `denied` (the user refused at the "
"provider), `provider` (the conversation with the provider failed, e.g. the "
"token exchange was rejected or userinfo errored), `error` (the hook raised "
"something other than `ValueError`), `invalid` (claims had no `subject`), "
"`unlinked` (the identity is not bound to a local account), `inactive` (the "
"account is rejected or disabled)."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:57
msgid ""
"解绑：`DELETE /api/v2/auth/identities/<name>`，请求体带当前密码。 "
"要求密码是为了防止只有第三方登录的账号把自己锁在门外。"
msgstr ""
"Unbinding: `DELETE /api/v2/auth/identities/<name>` with the current "
"password in the body. The password is required so an account that only "
"has third-party logins cannot lock itself out."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:59
msgid "登录页按钮由钩子自己在 `login.after_form` 插槽里声明，所以每个 Provider 的文案/图标 都可以不同，核心不用登记。"
msgstr ""
"The login-page button is declared by the hook itself in the "
"`login.after_form` slot, so every provider can have its own wording and "
"icon without registering anything in the core."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:62
msgid "账号解析顺序（`sapic/libs/users.py` 的 `resolve_oidc_user`）："
msgstr "Account resolution order (`resolve_oidc_user` in `sapic/libs/users.py`):"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:64
msgid "`(issuer, subject)` 已绑定 → 直接登录（账号已拒绝/禁用则拒绝，待审核可以登录）；"
msgstr "`(issuer, subject)` is already bound → sign in directly (refused when the "
"account is rejected or disabled; a pending account may sign in);"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:65
msgid "Provider 声明邮箱已验证、且本地同邮箱账号本身也验证过、且该账号还没绑过任何身份 → 自动关联；"
msgstr ""
"the provider reports a verified email, a local account with the same "
"verified email exists, and that account has not bound any identity yet → "
"link automatically;"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:67
msgid ""
"否则按 Provider 信息**新建本地账号**（`register_review` 开启时落到待审核， "
"仍然发会话、可以登录，只是不能上传），并创建默认相册。"
msgstr "otherwise **create a local account** from the provider data (landing in "
"pending review when `register_review` is on — it still gets a session and "
"can sign in, it just cannot upload) and create its default album."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:70
msgid "最小可用示例"
msgstr "Minimal working example"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:188
msgid ""
"Provider 拿到的 `config` 只有后台钩子页保存的键（`hooks_config[<hook>]`）， "
"不像存储驱动那样有「每个后端一份配置」。需要多套凭据就接入多个 Provider 包 （一个站点通常只配一个）。"
msgstr ""
"The `config` a provider receives only contains the keys saved on the "
"admin hook page (`hooks_config[<hook>]`); unlike storage drivers there is"
" no per-backend config. To support several credential sets, ship several "
"provider packages (a site normally configures just one)."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:192
msgid "现有实现参考"
msgstr "Existing reference implementation"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:194
msgid ""
"内置 `server/sapic/hooks/oidc.py`：走 OIDC discovery 文档， "
"`oidc_authorize_url` 从 `/.well-known/openid-configuration` 取授权端点， "
"`oidc_exchange` 用 `id_token` / userinfo 取 claims，并带 5 分钟 discovery 缓存。"
msgstr ""
"The built-in `server/sapic/hooks/oidc.py`: it reads the OIDC "
"discovery document, `oidc_authorize_url` takes the authorization endpoint"
" from `/.well-known/openid-configuration`, and `oidc_exchange` pulls "
"claims from the `id_token` / userinfo, with a 5-minute discovery cache."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:198
msgid "已知限制"
msgstr "Known limitations"

#: ../../extend/provider.md:200
msgid ""
"本地账号目前只保存**一组** `(oidc_issuer, oidc_subject)`。同时接入多个 Provider 时， "
"同一个账号只能绑定其中一个；再绑另一个会覆盖旧的（旧的登录方式随即失效）。 多身份并存需要单独的身份表，属于后续工作。"
msgstr ""
"A local account currently stores **one** `(oidc_issuer, oidc_subject)` "
"pair. With several providers connected an account can bind only one of "
"them; binding another overwrites the old one and the old login stops "
"working. Concurrent identities need a separate identity table and are "
"future work."

#: ../../extend/provider.md:203
msgid ""
"契约基于「授权码 + 服务端换 token」，不支持隐式流或纯前端 token 流程； 需要那样做的 Provider "
"应在钩子里自行完成，只把最终身份交给核心。"
msgstr ""
"The contract assumes the authorization-code flow with a server-side token"
" exchange; implicit or front-end-only token flows are not supported. A "
"provider that needs those should do the work inside the hook and hand the"
" final identity to the core."

